Licensing scope

CC0 1.0 Universal (licenses/CC0-1.0.txt): everything in this repository, reconstructions,
docs, research and data.

MIT (licenses/MIT.txt): the infrastructure in tools/, tests/, site/ and .github/.

Exceptions, because they are third-party:
- Units carrying GPL-3.0 declarations or headers (powerof3/CommonLibSSE, per their SPDX line or
  GPL notice) stay GPL-3.0; units with a CommonLibSSE-NG SPDX line keep its MIT notice.
- Units labelled SIBLING(fo4-private@1b765c70, author-permission) are used with the author's
  permission and are not dedicated under CC0.

Not covered: game assets, executables, trademarks and other third-party material. Nothing here
grants rights in Skyrim or Bethesda's IP.
